---

# Guiding Principle

The Advisor should be designed as a modular, transparent, and evidence-driven system where each component has a clearly defined responsibility.

Every architectural decision should faithfully implement the Advisor Intelligence Specification while remaining scalable, maintainable, and extensible for future versions of Financial Friday.
